ng up a bunch of places in the death zone, Kanata enters the final sector, but with the long straight at the end of the lap highlighting the 86's main weakness, can he hold on to his current position all the way to the checkered flag?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6NVkNmLmoqHwtXSQzL0JQ7bJoM0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6NVkNmLmoqHwtXSQzL0JQ7bJoM0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/154526/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"4774886","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kanata managed to haul the 86 up to unexpected heights at Odawara Pikes Peak, but the next race is on a course that is a lot flatter with fewer downhill sections where he can make up for his car's lack of power, so it's time to tune his ride!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y0ZpDOtfJ7qK2veJMHK9H9bLgbY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y0ZpDOtfJ7qK2veJMHK9H9bLgbY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/154526/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"4774887","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Qualifying begins for the second race of the season, which is set to take place at Lake Ashinoko. With Kanata set to do his run on a later day, other drivers get their moment to shine.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-12-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zmzVFH6Err4MBLKnCsn6O9nqPqg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zmzVFH6Err4MBLKnCsn6O9nqPqg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www